the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mfMLpneQdFEQ7kNvwGMK8dc&_nc_oc=AdopO_guQvFonnia-szgS4YwyOw8Vl7g_ABmN9dUfpQZdKn-aLqQv5EcPjAlfIGEU7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6flcmysYzuczkpMkWws7fGxhGDASqdDefscpZQqjvQxw&oe=6A170C83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uTIDqnpTwd0Q7kNvwGZYxdJ&_nc_oc=AdrA_8_5OfZe4UWoGhdH3H8kVTE1KUsvzRrnkz3Ofv4xsRoGyiwgNY1Zeu0C9PU01j4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Vu6SsnmYFS4-CAU8LS3rPM-EnKnS77GIhEP9fPYeKeA&oe=6A1704D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=no3VQL-aYGsQ7kNvwFfS8lI&_nc_oc=Adp77x8688Z4AKHDPm_TVh6l4irolX6Jrc3CMouRKFguT5bt7SOBoK2WyiST452tLAc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5wD2p2oR2zDevumbvwc7QqJFfa9DDY8eRZKl7AoA6LDQ&oe=6A16DFBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080